  "name": "Burrowing Leechpoles",
  "type": "feature",
  "img": "icons/creatures/invertebrates/leech-attack-green.webp",
  "system": {
    "featureForm": "reaction",
    "description": "<p>When the Abomination takes Major or greater damage, their skin erupts in an explosion of subcutaneous wrigglers. Each PC within Close range must make an Agility Reaction Roll. Targets who fail are covered in <strong>[[/r 2d4]]</strong> leechpoles, which burrow under their skin. Until the leechpoles are dug out with a successful Finesse Roll (21), any damage the target takes gains a +1 bonus for each leechpole under their skin.</p>",
